extends RefCounted
## The worlds of MR BLUE.
##
## Every level is a list of text "chunks" that are glued together left to right.
## Every chunk is exactly 14 rows tall; one character = one 16px tile.
##
##   .  air                     #  ground              X  brick wall
##   =  bridge (one-way)        o  coin                C  crate (breaks from below)
##   ?  coin block              M  multi-coin block    F  fruit block (+1 heart)
##   R  rock block (throwing)   L  1UP block           *  mana orb
##   H  platform moving sideways                       V  platform moving up (3 tiles)
##   E  elevator (up 6 tiles)   S  spring pad          D  crumbling plank
##   ^  spikes                  ~  lava
##   p  pinky (walker)          s  slime               u  purple slime (fast, 2 hits)
##   w  grump (throws rocks)    B  bat (flies)         r  charger (rushes you, 2 hits)
##   k  spiky slime (never stomp it)                   f  fireball leaping out of the lava below
##   Q  QUEEN SLIME (boss)      K  KING PINKY (final boss)
##   P  start                   c  checkpoint          G  goal flag
##   T  tree   b  bush   m  mushroom                   1-9  sign showing texts[n-1]
##
## Level options: theme (grass, autumn, night, swamp, ice, cave, sky, space, castle),
## time, slip (< 1 = icy floor), gravity (< 1 = moon jumps), scroll (px/s: the screen moves on its own).
##
## Heroes jump 2 tiles high (4 with the air jump) and clear gaps of about 4 tiles (6 running).
## A spring pad throws them 7 tiles up.

